      "text": "Aives breathes out a cloud of poisonous smoke that he can make curl around him or cling to his weapons.\n\nUntil the cloud dissipates at the start of his next turn, Aives is Concealed, his Strikes deal an extra 1d8 poison damage, and targets of his Strikes must succeed at a DC 22 Fortitude save save or become Sickened 1.",
